    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46921" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">super-vīvo</span></b> , xi,
		ĕre, v. n., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to outlive</i>, <i>survive</i> (post-Aug.; cf. supersum); with <i>dat.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Olympias non diu filiis supervixit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Just.
					28, 3, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gloriae suae triginta annis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					Ep. 2, 1, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">expeditioni superfuit et supervixit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Flor.
					2, 2, 14</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Spart. Had. 15</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">App. M. 1, p. 108, 27</span></i>;
			<i><span class="en">4</span></i>, p. 147, 22.—<b>
				<i>Absol.</i>
			</b>, <i><span class="en">Suet. Caes. 89</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Vulg. Exod.
				21, 21</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Amm. 18, 3,
		5</span></i>.</div>
